  "notes": [
    "Irregular -AR verb with an *e→ie* stem change (same pattern as *pensar*, *comenzar*, *empezar*): the stressed *e* in the stem becomes *ie* everywhere except nosotros/nosotras and the preterite/imperfect/future/conditional, which stay regular",
    "Nosotros forms always revert to the unstressed stem: *recomendamos* (Presente), *recomendemos* (Subjuntivo/Imperativo)",
    "Past participle: *recomendado* (regular)",
    "Means \"to recommend\" — *te recomiendo este restaurante* (I recommend this restaurant to you), *el médico le recomendó reposo* (the doctor recommended rest)",
    "Related: *recomendación* (recommendation), *recomendable* (advisable, recommendable)"
  ],
  "sourceFile": "Verbs/r/Recomendar.md"
